  <item>
    <title>兴酒LINK 07: 新南味 待客餐酒搭</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6968df67109824f9e1a852c8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6968df67109824f9e1a852c8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Jan 2026 13:11:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>兴酒LINK是和厦门建发JFC品尚中心合作出品的系列节目，每期我会和朋友去到品尚中心的一家餐厅，吃吃喝喝聊聊天，也跟大家分享一些有趣的话题吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后一期我们来到JFC B馆的小南筵，和两位嘉宾从餐酒搭聊到自家的待客菜，很愉快的下午酒。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾</span><br><span>Nana 「餐桌上的诗人」餐厅主理人</span><br><span>儒毅 「玉如意」餐厅主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 第一支酒 Central Otago Pinot Noir 2016</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="164">02:44</a> 分享一次让你愉悦的wine pairing经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 闽菜选什么酒餐搭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a> 第一支酒餐搭 ：三黄鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 第二支酒 Clare Valley shiraz 2022</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> 从饮食能反应这个地域的人的性格吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">22:14</a> 闽菜 可以看出什么福建人的性格？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 家里的待客菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 第二支酒餐搭：咏春醋猪脚</span><br><span></span><br><span>酒款</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqvCAsouGmOTgq4p7_vi6q4NRxFz.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>小南筵 菜品</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhX-63oNLPdjhi0pSQdkvuPvH23s.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsaNKpBVeLV4LlTGNENPZCEaxhVK.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjS7iOxRl4tcW5dbwfOv3oBOuQV2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>互动方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以通过小红书@xiiiiiwu找到主播留言互动</span><br><span>听友群：微信添加小助理 CheersPair</span><br><span>工作联系：</span><a href="mailto:echowoo828@gmail.com"><u><span>echowoo828@gmail.com</span></u></a><br><span><