    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>浪浪，酒精爱好者，现在是一位base在伦敦的调酒师</span><br><span>更多分享见小红书@流浪酒精</span></p><span></span><p><span>【酒友系列】第一期，很开心邀请到好朋友浪浪，伦敦行真的收获太多，一起录制、一起喝了很多酒吧。现在她base在伦敦，做着自己还满意的调酒师工作，超替她开心。本期浪浪推荐了好多家私藏酒吧，在shownote下方，记得收藏，如果有打卡了，欢迎来我俩的小红书留下你的反馈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 欢迎浪浪🍾️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">01:52</a> 酒店里的行政酒廊也这么推荐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a> 盘一盘浪浪的喝酒“史”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">13:36</a> 浪浪的调酒喜好这么特别吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 你听过蓝纹芝士调酒吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 浪浪的伦敦必喝酒吧名单（地址见shownote）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 酿酒师的工作如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1809">30:09</a> 这份工作让我更认识自己了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 伦敦调酒师福利这么好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">34:34</a> 一些共鸣：英文语境的我们有另一个人格</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们提到的伦敦酒吧，记得Google Map收藏</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Baudry Greene</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Satan’s Whiskers</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Bar Lotus</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Tayer+Elementary</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Nightjar Shoreditch</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Oriole</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Scarfes</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>互动方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以通过小红书@xiiiiiwu找到主播留言互动</span><br><span>听友群：微信添加小助理 CheersPair</span><br><span>工作联系：</span><a href="mailto:echowoo828@gmail.com"><u><span>echowoo828@gmail.com</span></u></a>