    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>必忠 新加坡威士忌社群WOODCASK主理人</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一次见WOODCASK和团队是在2023年成都酒展，这应该是最受欢迎的爱好者展位了，当时我在广泛吸收各种威士忌的阶段，所以到了WOODCASK那喝得很到位。后续大家各种酒展见了很多次，随着必忠也来厦门做分享和参加展会市集，大家更熟络来一点。趁着这次必中来做分享会，我特意约了他来聊一聊，很轻松很喜欢的一场交流。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> WOODCASK 初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 必忠的近期爱喝和风味变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 入门先和IB还是OB？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 15年创办WOODCASK的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 以WOODCASK的会员为例，威士忌的喜好有区域性吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> WOODCASK的包桶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> WOODCASK会做什么风格的酒展？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> 必忠最推荐的爱好者必去酒展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 必忠的收藏逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1749">29:09</a> 必忠如何看国内威士忌社群？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a> 必忠对厦门一支会的评价</span></p><span></span><p><span>互动方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以通过小红书@xiiiiiwu找到主播留言互动</span><br><span>听友群：微信添加小助理 CheersPair</span><br><span>工作联系：</span><a href="mailto:echowoo828@gmail.com"><u><span>echowoo828@gmail.com</span></u></a><br><span></span><br><span>收听方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>主推小宇宙播客app搜索【嬉游忌】订阅收听，欢迎你给我们多多评论！</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在苹果播客、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐、网易云音乐找到我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果节目还满意，欢迎在苹果播客为我点五星好评✌️</span></p>]]></description>
