  <item>
    <title>兴酒LINK 03: 花火大会！了解一下</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687a15e4a9dec92500f37ebc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687a15e4a9dec92500f37ebc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Jul 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>兴酒Link第三期来到JFC品尚中心的清業，一家本净割烹的日本料理餐厅。和两位朋友，一位是从小在日本长大的景瑜，另一位是在日本留学的Alice，我们一起聊聊即将到来的节日--花火大会。配合着清業的菜以及我从日本带回来的威士忌，愉快的下午又开启了。</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾</span><br><span>景瑜 毕业于北海道大学，现从事海外地产投资与资产配置</span><br><span>Alice 求学于日本早稻田大学，现从事内容营销</span></p><span></span><p><span>清業： 厦门JFC品尚中心店</span></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a> 日本传统节日-花火大会的由来与传统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 各地花火大会的不同玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 花火大会初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 花火大会市集中吃吃玩玩的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 日本为什么注重季节性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> 喝一杯静冈威士忌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 中日之间共同过的节日有哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a> 喝一杯津贯威士忌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a> 三位分享近期去日本印象深刻的料理（宫崎/北海道/京都）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1876">31:16</a> 一个八卦：九州差点成为日本首都</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1916">31:56</a> 日本为什么形成这样的餐桌文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 清業的哪道菜会让你想起日本的旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span>下午酒</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FndRFWXck6axuZQcqVhhUXCfYgVD.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>下午菜- 清業</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl69A_um8s-Pd-LHHB9Q7mI28ehY.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpxgUitw_Cs-ONHsw8Ld1h4fZH2J.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhA0vvYlDDNzyNYvQ-t1g3vYChnB.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvRfmRDNyXmAXYraplNfsMXXCLXP.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiLz2XQ3kNvDKPJn45v5y8G0XUc5.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqtB0aG1oUv1scBab_wMA_3j2znz.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmFkz0DNf7ecl2bvvQbaX7H-HMRS.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
