    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>兴酒Link第二期我们来到B馆4楼的珍宝餐厅，珍宝是一家新加坡菜餐厅，两位酒友 乐燕 Wing 都是厦大法语专业，那我们就一起聊聊语言视角下的南洋文化。除此之外呢，他们还是资深葡萄酒行业从业者。所以这期除了关于语言视角下的南洋，更有专业人士一起餐酒搭的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>乐燕 WSET官方认证讲师、WSET Diploma</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wing 聚酒主理人、 13年葡萄酒烈酒采购经验</span></p><span></span><p><span>酒款信息</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6ZmlsZTovLy8vcHJpdmF0ZS92YXIvZm9sZGVycy9xei90NDAxd2hwZDM3bjV0dGZxajFjNHc3bmMwMDAwZ24vVC9jb20ua2luZ3NvZnQud3Bzb2ZmaWNlLm1hYy93cHMtZWNoby9rc29odG1sLy93cHMxLmpwZw=="></p><span></span><p><span>Highlights</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 下午酒介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> 开启第一款酒 &amp;话题：语言视角下的南洋文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> 在学习语言的过程中，南洋一词是什么时候出现的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 语言对理解文化有什么作用？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> Singlish小测试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a>第二款酒：阿尔萨斯雷司令</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 第一次吃南洋菜的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> 第三款酒：阿尔萨斯橙酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 妈祖文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 橙酒餐搭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 从短剧《狮城山海》到爱国华侨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 第四款酒 波尔多美乐干红 &amp;话题：想到南洋会立马想到哪道菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>互动方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以通过小红书@xiiiiiwu找到主播留言互动</span><